# Working artefacts from a review pass. `.audit/` holds the finding briefs an agent was handed,
# `.shots/` holds screenshots taken by scripts/dev/shoot.mjs, and the two `.audit-*.json` files are
# the raw machine-readable record. All of them are reproducible and none belongs in history.
/.audit
/.audit-*.json
/.shots
/.ccx-wake.log
/.build-state.md

# Two stray capture artefacts at the repo root. `.shots$a.png` is a shell-quoting accident — the
# `$a` was meant to expand and the file belongs under `/.shots`, which is already ignored — and
# `image.png` is a 2.3 MB screenshot nothing references. Neither is source.
/image.png
/.shots$a.png

# The craft contact sheets as they arrived: 43 PNGs at 2048×1143, ~217 MB, extracted from the
# Centre's "Craft thumbnail" document. They are the INPUT to scripts/build-craft-sheets.ts and are
# never served — what ships is the encoded JPEG in public/craft/sheets/ and the generated manifest.
# Too large for history, and reproducible from the source document at any time.
/.craft-source

.vercel
.env*
